Package: hermes-hdr-experimental-player
Version: 1.0~experimental2
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: HDR Agent <hdr-agent@invalid>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), mpv (>= 0.41.0), libplacebo360 (>= 7.360.1), libavcodec62 (>= 7:8.1.2), libavutil60 (>= 7:8.1.2)
Description: Experimental native RPU-aware player launcher
 Uses existing Ubuntu mpv gpu-next, FFmpeg Dolby metadata and libplacebo
 reshaping. Follows the Wayland preferred target and stores private,
 advisory renderer evidence. No certified or full-fidelity Dolby claim.
 No compositor, audio configuration, display profile or session changes.
